// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @atomic_thread_fence_seq_cst
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @instruction_sync_fence
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @atomic_clear_exclusive

// Pass-through (intentionally not normalized):
// CIR-DAG: @ExclusiveAccess
// CIR-DAG: @hasExclusiveAccess
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @ExclusiveAccess
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @hasExclusiveAccess
